# API key configuration — DO NOT put real keys in any committed file.
#
# This app does NOT read a .env file anymore (a bundled .env ships inside the
# APK, so that mechanism was removed). Provide keys one of two ways instead:
#
# 1. At runtime (recommended): open the app and go to Settings -> API Keys.
#    Keys are stored on-device via SharedPreferences.
#
# 2. At build time, via --dart-define:
#      flutter run \
#        --dart-define=GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here \
#        --dart-define=DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=your_deepgram_api_key_here
#
# Where to get keys:
#   GEMINI_API_KEY   -> https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   DEEPGRAM_API_KEY -> https://console.deepgram.com
